  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening climat change adaptative capacities of women farmers in the Ou&#xE9;m&#xE9; valley in Benin</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Many people in the municipality of Adjohoun in Benin depend on agriculture, which is highly vulnerable to the impacts of climate change. Female smallholder farmers are especially vulnerable due to the unequal access to land and investment opportunities. The project improved the adaptation capacities of vulnerable female smallholder farmers and local stakeholders in the municipality of Adjohoun. This has been achieved through access to knowledge, innovative agricultural practices, agricultural equipment, and better management of climate risks.</narrative>
  </description>
